{"seq":3,"slug":"homing-guidance","title":"制导与追踪：飞行中主动修正航向","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-projectile-ballistics/motion/homing-guidance","wordCount":1688,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"制导与追踪-飞行中主动修正航向\">制导与追踪：飞行中主动修正航向</h1><p>拦截提前量解决的是「开火那一刻朝哪打」，可一旦目标在弹飞出后变向，直射弹就无能为力了。制导弹是另一条路：它不指望一次算准，而是在飞行途中持续观察目标、不断修正自己的航向——《光环》的追踪手雷、《军团要塞》的哨兵火箭、各种「锁定后必中」的导弹，靠的都是导引律。这篇讲制导算法本身：从最朴素的纯追踪，到工程与现实导弹都在用的比例导引（PN），以及绕不开的转向约束与锁定逻辑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-制导系统的三个部件\">核心概念：制导系统的三个部件</h2><p>任何制导投射物都由三部分构成，缺一不可。理解这个分解，后面所有导引律都是在替换其中一块：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[目标] --&gt; B[导引律&lt;br/&gt;计算期望转向]&#10;    C[投射物当前状态&lt;br/&gt;位置/速度/朝向] --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt; D[转向约束&lt;br/&gt;最大角速度限制]&#10;    D --&gt; E[更新速度方向]&#10;    E --&gt; F[按运动章积分位置&lt;br/&gt;见抛射轨迹]&#10;    F --&gt; C&#10;    G[锁定逻辑] --&gt; A&#10;    G --&gt; H{目标丢失/被遮挡?}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[失锁: 直飞或自毁]\">flowchart TD\n    A[目标] --&gt; B[导引律&lt;br/&gt;计算期望转向]\n    C[投射物当前状态&lt;br/&gt;位置/速度/朝向] --&gt; B\n    B --&gt; D[转向约束&lt;br/&gt;最大角速度限制]\n    D --&gt; E[更新速度方向]\n    E --&gt; F[按运动章积分位置&lt;br/&gt;见抛射轨迹]\n    F --&gt; C\n    G[锁定逻辑] --&gt; A\n    G --&gt; H{目标丢失/被遮挡?}\n    H --&gt;|是| I[失锁: 直飞或自毁]</pre><p><strong>导引律</strong>决定「理想上该往哪转」，<strong>转向约束</strong>把理想转向裁剪到投射物物理能做到的范围（导弹不能瞬间掉头），<strong>锁定逻辑</strong>负责选定和维持目标。位置积分仍然复用<a href=\"ballistic-trajectory\">抛射轨迹</a>那套——制导只改速度方向，不改积分方式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"纯追踪-最简单也最笨\">纯追踪：最简单也最笨</h2><p>最直觉的导引律叫纯追踪（pure pursuit）：每帧把速度方向直接转向「当前指向目标的方向」。实现只有一行——求出投射物到目标的单位向量，把速度旋转过去（受转向速率限制）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{d} = \\frac{\\vec{p}_{target} - \\vec{p}_{missile}}{|\\vec{p}_{target} - \\vec{p}_{missile}|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3631em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.391em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ss</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ss</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>纯追踪的问题是<strong>永远在追尾</strong>。因为它总是指向目标的当前位置而非未来位置，面对横向移动的目标，导弹会画出一条不断向内弯的「追尾曲线」，末段需要极大的转向角，常常因为转不过来而脱靶或在目标身后绕圈。它只在目标慢、机动弱，或投射物转向能力极强时才够用。好处是极其简单、行为可预测，很多休闲游戏的追踪弹就用它，甚至故意保留「能被绕圈甩掉」的手感。</p>\n<h2 id=\"比例导引-现实导弹的选择\">比例导引：现实导弹的选择</h2><p>比例导引（Proportional Navigation, PN）是现实防空导弹和严肃游戏制导的主流。它的核心洞察是：<strong>不要盯着目标的位置，要盯着视线（LOS）的转动</strong>。如果投射物与目标之间的连线（视线）角度不再变化，那么两者必然在碰撞航线上，早晚相撞。PN 就是驱动视线角速度归零。</p>\n<p>导引指令是让投射物的转向速率正比于视线角速度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>λ</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_{cmd} = N \\cdot V_c \\cdot \\dot{\\lambda}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1389em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>λ</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dot{\\lambda}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1389em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是视线角速度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是接近速度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是导航常数（现实中常取 3–5）。直觉上：如果目标相对你在视野里往左飘，就往左多转一点，直到它在视野里「钉住不动」。PN 天然做到了提前量——它会走一条「切向拦截」的直线化航线，而非追尾曲线，末段过载小得多，命中率远高于纯追踪。</p>\n<p>游戏里实现 PN 不必照搬空气动力学，只要每帧算出视线方向的变化率，据此给速度方向施加正比的横向修正即可。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 这个参数直接对应手感：小则导弹「慢半拍」容易被甩，大则「咬得紧」难以摆脱——它是制导弹平衡的主旋钮。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三种导引律对比与转向约束\">三种导引律对比与转向约束</h2><p>把常见导引律放在一起，取舍就清楚了：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>导引律</th>\n<th>瞄准依据</th>\n<th>航线</th>\n<th>末段过载</th>\n<th>手感</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>纯追踪</td>\n<td>目标当前位置</td>\n<td>追尾内弯曲线</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>易被绕圈甩掉</td>\n<td>休闲、慢目标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提前追踪</td>\n<td>目标预测位置</td>\n<td>近似直线</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>较难摆脱</td>\n<td>中等制导</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>比例导引 PN</td>\n<td>视线角速度</td>\n<td>切向拦截直线</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>咬得紧、真实</td>\n<td>严肃制导、导弹</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>无论用哪种导引律，都必须叠加<strong>转向约束</strong>。真实感和可玩性都要求导弹不能瞬间改向，所以每帧把「期望转向角」裁剪到 <code>最大角速度 × Δt</code> 之内。这个最大角速度（转弯半径的倒数体现）是另一个关键平衡参数：转向能力太强则无解可躲、太弱则形同虚设。给制导弹设一个「有限但够用」的转向上限，正是留出「靠急转、靠障碍物遮挡来甩弹」的反制空间——这与直射弹靠走位躲避是同一种设计取向，见<a href=\"../foundations/why-projectiles\">为何弹道系统</a>里讲的躲避维度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"锁定-失锁与反制\">锁定、失锁与反制</h2><p>制导弹还要回答「追谁、什么时候放弃追」。锁定逻辑通常包括：视野锥内选目标、维持锁定需目标不被遮挡、超出最大追踪距离或时间则失锁。失锁后的行为是重要的设计决策——是直飞、自毁，还是重新搜索新目标，直接影响武器强度与反制手段。</p>\n<p>反制是制导玩法的另一半。现实里有热诱弹、干扰，游戏里则常见「拉视线到掩体后触发失锁」「急转让导弹转不过来」「用地形让导弹撞墙」。好的制导设计会确保这些反制真实有效，否则「必中导弹」会破坏对战公平。制导弹在多人环境下还有额外的同步难题——它的航线依赖持续的目标状态，客户端与服务器的目标位置若不一致，制导轨迹会分叉，这属于<a href=\"../practice/projectile-netcode\">网络与延迟补偿</a>的范畴。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>制导系统由导引律（该往哪转）、转向约束（能往哪转）、锁定逻辑（追谁）三部件构成，位置积分仍复用运动章。</li>\n<li>纯追踪指向目标当前位置，简单但走追尾内弯曲线、末段过载大、易被绕圈甩掉，只适合慢目标或强转向弹。</li>\n<li>比例导引（PN）盯的是视线角速度而非位置，驱动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>λ</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_{cmd}=N V_c \\dot\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0813em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1389em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 归零视线转动，走切向拦截直线、末段过载小、命中率高，是严肃制导的主流；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是核心手感参数。</li>\n<li>转向速率上限与失锁/反制逻辑共同决定制导弹的平衡，故意留下急转、遮挡等反制空间才能保证公平。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章：<a href=\"ballistic-trajectory\">抛射轨迹</a> —— 制导只改速度方向，位置仍按这里的积分推进。</li>\n<li>同章：<a href=\"lead-prediction\">提前量与预测</a> —— 直射弹的「一次算准」，与制导的「持续修正」互为替代。</li>\n<li>命中章：<a href=\"../collision/projectile-collision\">投射物碰撞</a> —— 制导弹高速转向时的连续检测同样关键。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../game-ai/\">游戏 AI · 转向行为</a> —— 导引律与转向行为（steering behaviors）共享数学基础。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"制导与追踪：飞行中主动修正航向","id":"制导与追踪-飞行中主动修正航向"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：制导系统的三个部件","id":"核心概念-制导系统的三个部件"},{"level":2,"text":"纯追踪：最简单也最笨","id":"纯追踪-最简单也最笨"},{"level":2,"text":"比例导引：现实导弹的选择","id":"比例导引-现实导弹的选择"},{"level":2,"text":"三种导引律对比与转向约束","id":"三种导引律对比与转向约束"},{"level":2,"text":"锁定、失锁与反制","id":"锁定-失锁与反制"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"提前量与预测：往目标的未来开火","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-projectile-ballistics/motion/lead-prediction"},"next":{"title":"投射物碰撞：连续检测与穿墙的隐蔽 bug","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-projectile-ballistics/collision/projectile-collision"}}